# Replace with the domain or subdomain pointed at this VPS. An A record for it
# must already resolve to the server's IP before the first start, because Caddy
# proves control of the name over port 80 to get the certificate -- a domain
# that does not resolve yet fails the challenge and retries with backoff.
#
# For a first run without a domain, replace the whole block with `:80 {` and the
# same reverse_proxy line. Sign-in will not work over plain http (Supabase's
# auth cookies are Secure), but the app will serve and the agent path can be
# tested end to end.
app.example.com {
	reverse_proxy web:3100
}
